      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# 🌍 Plate Tectonics\n\n> **Earth is alive beneath our feet.**\n\n---\n\n### 🌎 A Planet in Motion\n\nEarth's outer shell is divided into **tectonic plates** that drift slowly across the mantle.\n\n🟦 **Divergent Boundaries** create new crust.\n\n🟥 **Convergent Boundaries** build mountains and fuel volcanoes.\n\n🟪 **Transform Boundaries** unleash earthquakes.\n\n---\n\n## 🔥 The Big Idea\n\nMantle heat drives plate motion.\n\nPlate motion shapes continents.\n\nPlate boundaries create nearly every major geological feature on Earth.\n\n🌋 ⛰️ 🌊 🌎",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1784925714237,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
