      "data": {
        "markdown": "## ↔️ Divergent Boundary\n\nTwo plates move **apart**.\n\nMagma rises into the opening and cools into new crust. Under the oceans, this produces long mid-ocean ridges and gradually widens ocean basins.\n\n**Common features**\n\n- Mid-ocean ridges\n- Rift valleys\n- Shallow earthquakes\n- New volcanic crust",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
