      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## ⇆ Transform Boundary\n\nTwo plates slide **past each other**.\n\nTheir rough edges may lock together while stress accumulates. When the plates suddenly slip, the stored energy travels through Earth as an earthquake.\n\n**Common features**\n\n- Strike-slip faults\n- Shallow earthquakes\n- Offset landforms\n- Little or no volcanism",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
